<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Otis says in talks, cautions shareholders.</title>
<headline>Otis says in talks, cautions shareholders.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1997-08-04</dateline>
<text>
<p>South Africa's Otis Elevator Co Ltd said on Monday that it was in negotiations which could have an effect on the share price of the company.</p>
<p>It said shareholders should continue exercising caution in their dealings in Otis shares until a further announcement.</p>
<p>It gave no further details in a brief statement.</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
